{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.BorelWatsonSectorTransport","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.BorelWatsonSectorTransport","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.BorelWatsonTransport","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.BorelWatsonSector"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Borel.analyticAt_sectorTransport","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Borel.analyticAt_sectorTransport","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/BorelWatsonSectorTransport.lean#L52-L62","doc":"The transport `Φ_t` is holomorphic on the open sector: `z^t` is analytic on\nthe slit plane (brick 4b-i, which contains the sector) and is nonzero there\n(`‖z^t‖ = ‖z‖^t > 0`), so its inverse is analytic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Borel.sectorTransport_mapsTo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Borel.sectorTransport_mapsTo","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/BorelWatsonSectorTransport.lean#L44-L50","doc":"The transport `Φ_t` maps the open sector `{z ≠ 0 : |arg z| < π/(2t)}` into\nthe open right half-plane `{re > 0}`: `z^t` lands in `{re > 0}` (brick 4b-i)\nand inversion preserves it (brick 4a). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Borel.sectorTransport","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Borel.sectorTransport","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/BorelWatsonSectorTransport.lean#L41-L42","doc":"The **composed sector→half-plane transport** `Φ_t(z) = (z^t)⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}